# Hook Relay
error-hook-approval-pending = That action is still waiting for your approval, so it was stopped. Decide on it, then try again.
error-hook-approval-unavailable = ordin couldn't ask for approval, so that action was stopped. Try again.
error-hook-decision-timeout = ordin took too long to check that action, so it was stopped. Try again.
error-hook-endpoint-too-long = ordin couldn't start its checks because its storage location is too long. Move ordin's folder somewhere shorter.
error-hook-internal = ordin couldn't check that action, so it was stopped. Try again.
error-hook-listen-failed = ordin couldn't start its checks because another copy of ordin is already running. Close it and try again.
error-hook-malformed = ordin couldn't read that action, so it was stopped. Try again.
error-hook-peer-refused = That action came from another user on this computer, so it was stopped.
error-hook-protocol-unsupported = That action came from a different version of ordin, so it was stopped. Update ordin and try again.
error-hook-random-unavailable = ordin couldn't start its checks because this computer couldn't supply what it needs. Restart your computer and try again.
error-hook-replayed = ordin has already seen that action, so it was stopped. Try again.
error-hook-session-exists = ordin couldn't start that work because it is already running.
error-hook-session-mismatch = That action doesn't belong to this work, so it was stopped. Try again.
error-hook-session-unknown = That action isn't part of any work in progress, so it was stopped. Start the work again.
error-hook-store-unavailable = ordin couldn't check that action because it couldn't save or read its records. Try again.
error-hook-unauthenticated = ordin couldn't confirm that action came from itself, so it was stopped. Try again.
